 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "g1.0",
   "t0": 0.95,
   "t1": 4.88,
   "speech_end": 4.98,
   "text": "Every year, pests destroy up to 40% of the world's crops."
  },
  {
   "id": "g1.1",
   "t0": 4.93,
   "t1": 8.24,
   "speech_end": 8.34,
   "text": "And as the climate warms, many of them breed faster."
  },
  {
   "id": "g1.2",
   "t0": 8.29,
   "t1": 10.24,
   "speech_end": 10.34,
   "text": "So farmers spray more often,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g1.3",
   "t0": 10.29,
   "t1": 13.45,
   "speech_end": 13.0,
   "text": "pay more, and their soil grows poorer."
  },
  {
   "id": "g2.0",
   "t0": 13.95,
   "t1": 16.54,
   "speech_end": 16.64,
   "text": "Field Shift turns NASA's view of the Earth"
  },
  {
   "id": "g2.1",
   "t0": 16.59,
   "t1": 18.89,
   "speech_end": 18.44,
   "text": "into advice for one field."
  },
  {
   "id": "g2.2",
   "t0": 19.05,
   "t1": 20.86,
   "speech_end": 20.96,
   "text": "Here is how it works, on a pea field"
  },
  {
   "id": "g2.3",
   "t0": 20.91,
   "t1": 23.15,
   "speech_end": 22.7,
   "text": "in the Huaral valley, in Peru."
  },
  {
   "id": "g3.0",
   "t0": 24.55,
   "t1": 30.33,
   "speech_end": 29.88,
   "text": "Start with your field. Use your GPS, search a place, or open the example site."
  },
  {
   "id": "g3.1",
   "t0": 30.57,
   "t1": 33.37,
   "speech_end": 32.92,
   "text": "Drop a point, or draw the outline."
  },
  {
   "id": "g3.2",
   "t0": 33.83,
   "t1": 36.33,
   "speech_end": 35.88,
   "text": "Field Shift measures the area for you."
  },
  {
   "id": "g4.0",
   "t0": 38.37,
   "t1": 41.3,
   "speech_end": 40.92,
   "text": "Then tell it what you would tell your agronomist."
  },
  {
   "id": "g4.1",
   "t0": 41.35,
   "t1": 44.9,
   "speech_end": 44.58,
   "text": "What grows now, what grew before, how you water."
  },
  {
   "id": "g4.2",
   "t0": 44.95,
   "t1": 46.97,
   "speech_end": 46.52,
   "text": "If you don't know, say so."
  },
  {
   "id": "g4.3",
   "t0": 47.11,
   "t1": 50.54,
   "speech_end": 50.1,
   "text": "Send photos at full resolution, or simply talk."
  },
  {
   "id": "g4.4",
   "t0": 50.59,
   "t1": 54.81,
   "speech_end": 54.36,
   "text": "It asks for what is missing, like a closer look at the underside of a leaf."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.0",
   "t0": 56.45,
   "t1": 59.59,
   "speech_end": 59.14,
   "text": "Meanwhile, NASA data reads your field."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.1",
   "t0": 59.87,
   "t1": 62.42,
   "speech_end": 62.52,
   "text": "40 years of NASA POWER weather show these weeks"
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.2",
   "t0": 62.47,
   "t1": 65.03,
   "speech_end": 64.58,
   "text": "running 5 °C warmer than normal."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.3",
   "t0": 65.35,
   "t1": 68.15,
   "speech_end": 67.7,
   "text": "NASA's SMAP satellite measures soil moisture."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.4",
   "t0": 68.45,
   "t1": 72.35,
   "speech_end": 71.9,
   "text": "Sentinel-2 maps crop vigor, 10 m per pixel."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.5",
   "t0": 72.75,
   "t1": 75.04,
   "speech_end": 74.78,
   "text": "Every reading shows its source, its date,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g5a.6",
   "t0": 75.09,
   "t1": 78.21,
   "speech_end": 77.76,
   "text": "and whether it describes your field or the whole region."
  },
  {
   "id": "g5b.0",
   "t0": 79.67,
   "t1": 82.91,
   "speech_end": 82.46,
   "text": "From the temperature, degree-days count pest generations:"
  },
  {
   "id": "g5b.1",
   "t0": 83.27,
   "t1": 85.93,
   "speech_end": 85.48,
   "text": "aphids here complete about 3 more generations than normal."
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.0",
   "t0": 87.55,
   "t1": 90.05,
   "speech_end": 89.6,
   "text": "Then the readings become a plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.1",
   "t0": 90.47,
   "t1": 92.28,
   "speech_end": 92.38,
   "text": "Prevention ranks the pests likely on your field,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.2",
   "t0": 92.33,
   "t1": 95.61,
   "speech_end": 95.16,
   "text": "with NASA's GEOS-FP weather forecast."
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.3",
   "t0": 95.75,
   "t1": 98.42,
   "speech_end": 98.52,
   "text": "Organic care names the natural enemies to protect,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.4",
   "t0": 98.47,
   "t1": 101.18,
   "speech_end": 101.28,
   "text": "like lady beetles and parasitoid wasps,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.5",
   "t0": 101.23,
   "t1": 104.23,
   "speech_end": 103.78,
   "text": "and beneficial fungi such as Trichoderma."
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.6",
   "t0": 104.67,
   "t1": 107.3,
   "speech_end": 107.4,
   "text": "Rotation compares your current rotation with two alternatives,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.7",
   "t0": 107.35,
   "t1": 109.72,
   "speech_end": 109.82,
   "text": "for soil health, water and pest cycles."
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.8",
   "t0": 109.77,
   "t1": 113.04,
   "speech_end": 112.64,
   "text": "And you can ask: what if I grow avocado?"
  },
  {
   "id": "g6.9",
   "t0": 113.09,
   "t1": 114.89,
   "speech_end": 114.26,
   "text": "It is scored the same way."
  },
  {
   "id": "g7.0",
   "t0": 116.95,
   "t1": 120.46,
   "speech_end": 120.56,
   "text": "It all ends in a pre-diagnosis, not a diagnosis."
  },
  {
   "id": "g7.1",
   "t0": 120.51,
   "t1": 123.76,
   "speech_end": 123.86,
   "text": "Download the technical sheet, with every number cited,"
  },
  {
   "id": "g7.2",
   "t0": 123.81,
   "t1": 126.29,
   "speech_end": 125.84,
   "text": "and confirm it with your agronomist."
  },
  {
   "id": "g8.0",
   "t0": 129.05,
   "t1": 131.39,
   "speech_end": 130.94,
   "text": "NASA watches the whole planet."
  },
  {
   "id": "g8.1",
   "t0": 131.61,
   "t1": 133.99,
   "speech_end": 133.54,
   "text": "Field Shift helps you read your own field."
  }
 ]
}